{"seq":3,"slug":"nuxt-data-fetching","title":"Nuxt 数据获取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-data-fetching","wordCount":557,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"nuxt-数据获取\">Nuxt 数据获取</h1><h2 id=\"数据获取策略\">数据获取策略</h2><p>Nuxt 3 提供了多种数据获取方式，每种适用于不同场景。核心 API 包括 <code>useFetch</code>、<code>useAsyncData</code> 和 <code>$fetch</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Need[&quot;需要获取数据&quot;]&#10;    Need --&gt; Q1{&quot;在组件中?&quot;}&#10;    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Q2{&quot;需要 SSR?&quot;}&#10;    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; UF[&quot;useFetch / useAsyncData&quot;]&#10;    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; DF[&quot;$fetch(仅客户端)&quot;]&#10;    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q3{&quot;在 server/ 中?&quot;}&#10;    Q3 -- 是 --&gt; DF2[&quot;$fetch / 直接调用&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Need[\"需要获取数据\"]\n    Need --&gt; Q1{\"在组件中?\"}\n    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Q2{\"需要 SSR?\"}\n    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; UF[\"useFetch / useAsyncData\"]\n    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; DF[\"$fetch(仅客户端)\"]\n    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; Q3{\"在 server/ 中?\"}\n    Q3 -- 是 --&gt; DF2[\"$fetch / 直接调用\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>useFetch</strong>：<code>useAsyncData</code> + <code>$fetch</code> 的组合封装，自动处理 SSR 到客户端的数据传递，是最常用的数据获取 API。</li>\n<li><strong>useAsyncData</strong>：更灵活的上层封装，可承载任意异步逻辑并支持多请求组合。</li>\n<li><strong>$fetch</strong>：基于 ofetch 的底层 HTTP 客户端，客户端与服务端通用，但组件 <code>setup</code> 中直接用会导致重复请求。</li>\n<li><strong>payload</strong>：Nuxt 注入 HTML 的序列化数据载体，让 hydration 时复用服务端结果而非重新请求。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存与刷新</strong>：<code>key</code> 标识请求、<code>getCachedData</code> 定义命中策略、<code>refresh</code> 手动重取。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"usefetch\">useFetch</h2><p><code>useFetch</code> 是 Nuxt 中最常用的数据获取方式，它包装了 <code>useAsyncData</code> + <code>$fetch</code>，支持 SSR 和客户端请求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Post {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  body: string;&#10;  createdAt: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const { data, status, error, refresh } = await useFetch&lt;Post[]&gt;(&#39;/api/posts&#39;, {&#10;  query: { page: 1, limit: 10 },&#10;  headers: { &#39;Accept-Language&#39;: &#39;zh-CN&#39; },&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div&gt;&#10;    &lt;div v-if=&quot;status === &#39;pending&#39;&quot;&gt;加载中...&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;div v-else-if=&quot;error&quot;&gt;错误：{{ error.message }}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;ul v-else&gt;&#10;      &lt;li v-for=&quot;post in data&quot; :key=&quot;post.id&quot;&gt;&#10;        {{ post.title }}&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;button @click=&quot;refresh()&quot;&gt;刷新&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Post {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  createdAt: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { data, status, error, refresh } = await useFetch&#x3C;Post[]>('/api/posts', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  query: { page: 1, limit: 10 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  headers: { 'Accept-Language': 'zh-CN' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div v-if=\"status === 'pending'\">加载中...&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div v-else-if=\"error\">错误：{{ error.message }}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul v-else></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;li v-for=\"post in data\" :key=\"post.id\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {{ post.title }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button @click=\"refresh()\">刷新&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"usefetch-返回值\">useFetch 返回值</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>data</code></td>\n<td><code>Ref&lt;T | null&gt;</code></td>\n<td>响应数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>status</code></td>\n<td><code>Ref&lt;&#39;idle&#39; | &#39;pending&#39; | &#39;success&#39; | &#39;error&#39;&gt;</code></td>\n<td>请求状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>error</code></td>\n<td><code>Ref&lt;Error | null&gt;</code></td>\n<td>错误信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>refresh</code></td>\n<td><code>() =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td>\n<td>手动刷新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>execute</code></td>\n<td><code>() =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td>\n<td>手动执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clear</code></td>\n<td><code>() =&gt; void</code></td>\n<td>清除数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"监听参数变化\">监听参数变化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const page = ref&lt;number&gt;(1);&#10;const category = ref&lt;string&gt;(&#39;all&#39;);&#10;&#10;const { data: posts } = await useFetch&lt;Post[]&gt;(&#39;/api/posts&#39;, {&#10;  query: { page, category },&#10;  watch: [page, category],&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const page = ref&#x3C;number>(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const category = ref&#x3C;string>('all');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { data: posts } = await useFetch&#x3C;Post[]>('/api/posts', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  query: { page, category },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  watch: [page, category],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"useasyncdata\">useAsyncData</h2><p><code>useAsyncData</code> 提供更灵活的控制，适合自定义数据获取逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const { data: user } = await useAsyncData(&#39;user-profile&#39;, () =&gt; $fetch&lt;User&gt;(&#39;/api/user/me&#39;));&#10;&#10;const { data: stats } = await useAsyncData(&#10;  &#39;dashboard-stats&#39;,&#10;  async () =&gt; {&#10;    const [visits, orders, revenue] = await Promise.all([&#10;      $fetch&lt;number&gt;(&#39;/api/stats/visits&#39;),&#10;      $fetch&lt;number&gt;(&#39;/api/stats/orders&#39;),&#10;      $fetch&lt;number&gt;(&#39;/api/stats/revenue&#39;),&#10;    ]);&#10;    return { visits, orders, revenue };&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    transform: (raw) =&gt; ({&#10;      ...raw,&#10;      revenueFormatted: `¥${raw.revenue.toLocaleString()}`,&#10;    }),&#10;  },&#10;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { data: user } = await useAsyncData('user-profile', () => $fetch&#x3C;User>('/api/user/me'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { data: stats } = await useAsyncData(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'dashboard-stats',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  async () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const [visits, orders, revenue] = await Promise.all([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      $fetch&#x3C;number>('/api/stats/visits'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      $fetch&#x3C;number>('/api/stats/orders'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      $fetch&#x3C;number>('/api/stats/revenue'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return { visits, orders, revenue };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    transform: (raw) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ...raw,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      revenueFormatted: `¥${raw.revenue.toLocaleString()}`,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"usefetch-vs-useasyncdata\">useFetch vs useAsyncData</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>useFetch</th>\n<th>useAsyncData</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API 简洁度</td>\n<td>更简洁</td>\n<td>需要手动调 <code>$fetch</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>仅限 HTTP 请求</td>\n<td>任意异步逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>key 管理</td>\n<td>自动生成</td>\n<td>手动指定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多请求组合</td>\n<td>多次调用</td>\n<td><code>Promise.all</code> 组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>transform</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fetch\">$fetch</h2><p><code>$fetch</code> 是 Nuxt 基于 ofetch 的底层 HTTP 客户端，可在客户端和服务端通用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 服务端 API 中使用&#10;// server/api/enriched-posts.ts&#10;export default defineEventHandler(async () =&gt; {&#10;  const posts = await $fetch&lt;Post[]&gt;(&#39;https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts&#39;);&#10;&#10;  return posts.map((post) =&gt; ({&#10;    ...post,&#10;    excerpt: post.body.slice(0, 100),&#10;  }));&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务端 API 中使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// server/api/enriched-posts.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineEventHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> posts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> $fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">post,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    excerpt: post.body.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 客户端事件处理中使用（非 SSR） --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;async function submitForm(data: FormData) {&#10;  try {&#10;    const result = await $fetch(&#39;/api/submit&#39;, {&#10;      method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;      body: data,&#10;    });&#10;    console.log(&#39;提交成功:&#39;, result);&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    console.error(&#39;提交失败:&#39;, error);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 客户端事件处理中使用（非 SSR） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function submitForm(data: FormData) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const result = await $fetch('/api/submit', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      method: 'POST',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      body: data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console.log('提交成功:', result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } catch (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console.error('提交失败:', error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在组件 <code>setup</code> 中直接使用 <code>$fetch</code> 会导致数据在 SSR 和客户端各获取一次。应使用 <code>useFetch</code> 或 <code>useAsyncData</code> 包裹，确保 SSR 时获取的数据能自动传递到客户端。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存策略\">缓存策略</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const { data } = await useFetch&lt;Config&gt;(&#39;/api/config&#39;, {&#10;  key: &#39;app-config&#39;,&#10;  getCachedData: (key, nuxtApp) =&gt; {&#10;    return nuxtApp.payload.data[key] || nuxtApp.static.data[key];&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useFetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app-config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getCachedData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nuxtApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nuxtApp.payload.data[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nuxtApp.static.data[key];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    R[&quot;请求数据&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; C{&quot;缓存中有?&quot;}&#10;    C -- 是 --&gt; CR[&quot;返回缓存&quot;]&#10;    C -- 否 --&gt; F[&quot;发起请求&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; S[&quot;存入缓存&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; RD[&quot;返回数据&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    R[\"请求数据\"]\n    R --&gt; C{\"缓存中有?\"}\n    C -- 是 --&gt; CR[\"返回缓存\"]\n    C -- 否 --&gt; F[\"发起请求\"]\n    F --&gt; S[\"存入缓存\"]\n    S --&gt; RD[\"返回数据\"]</pre><h3 id=\"手动控制刷新\">手动控制刷新</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const { data, refresh, status } = await useFetch&lt;Post[]&gt;(&#39;/api/posts&#39;);&#10;&#10;async function handleRefresh() {&#10;  await refresh();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 定时刷新&#10;const { pause, resume } = useIntervalFn(refresh, 30000);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { data, refresh, status } = await useFetch&#x3C;Post[]>('/api/posts');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function handleRefresh() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await refresh();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 定时刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { pause, resume } = useIntervalFn(refresh, 30000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h2><h3 id=\"组件级错误处理\">组件级错误处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const { data, error } = await useFetch&lt;Product[]&gt;(&#39;/api/products&#39;);&#10;&#10;if (error.value) {&#10;  throw createError({&#10;    statusCode: error.value.statusCode ?? 500,&#10;    statusMessage: error.value.message,&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { data, error } = await useFetch&#x3C;Product[]>('/api/products');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (error.value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  throw createError({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    statusCode: error.value.statusCode ?? 500,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    statusMessage: error.value.message,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"全局错误页面\">全局错误页面</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- error.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const props = defineProps&lt;{&#10;  error: { statusCode: number; statusMessage: string };&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&#10;function handleClear() {&#10;  clearError({ redirect: &#39;/&#39; });&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div class=&quot;error-page&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;h1&gt;{{ error.statusCode }}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;{{ error.statusMessage }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;button @click=&quot;handleClear&quot;&gt;返回首页&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- error.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = defineProps&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  error: { statusCode: number; statusMessage: string };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function handleClear() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  clearError({ redirect: '/' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div class=\"error-page\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;h1>{{ error.statusCode }}&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;p>{{ error.statusMessage }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button @click=\"handleClear\">返回首页&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"payload-与-ssr-数据传递\">Payload 与 SSR 数据传递</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client as 浏览器&#10;    participant Server as Nuxt Server&#10;    participant API as API 服务&#10;&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: 请求页面&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;API: useFetch(服务端执行)&#10;    API--&gt;&gt;Server: 返回数据&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 渲染 HTML + 注入 payload&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: HTML + payload&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Client: Hydration(使用 payload 数据)&#10;    Note over Client: 客户端不再重复请求\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client as 浏览器\n    participant Server as Nuxt Server\n    participant API as API 服务\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: 请求页面\n    Server-&gt;&gt;API: useFetch(服务端执行)\n    API--&gt;&gt;Server: 返回数据\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 渲染 HTML + 注入 payload\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: HTML + payload\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Client: Hydration(使用 payload 数据)\n    Note over Client: 客户端不再重复请求</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>useFetch</code> 是最常用的数据获取 API，自动处理 SSR → 客户端的数据传递</li>\n<li><code>useAsyncData</code> 提供更灵活的控制，支持多请求组合和自定义获取逻辑</li>\n<li><code>$fetch</code> 是底层 HTTP 客户端，在事件处理函数和服务端 API 中使用</li>\n<li>组件 <code>setup</code> 中应避免直接使用 <code>$fetch</code>，防止重复请求</li>\n<li>通过 <code>key</code> 和 <code>getCachedData</code> 控制缓存策略，<code>refresh</code> 手动刷新数据</li>\n<li>Nuxt 自动将 SSR 数据通过 <strong>payload</strong> 传递到客户端，避免 hydration 时重复请求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nuxt 数据获取","id":"nuxt-数据获取"},{"level":2,"text":"数据获取策略","id":"数据获取策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"useFetch","id":"usefetch"},{"level":3,"text":"useFetch 返回值","id":"usefetch-返回值"},{"level":3,"text":"监听参数变化","id":"监听参数变化"},{"level":2,"text":"useAsyncData","id":"useasyncdata"},{"level":3,"text":"useFetch vs useAsyncData","id":"usefetch-vs-useasyncdata"},{"level":2,"text":"$fetch","id":"fetch"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存策略","id":"缓存策略"},{"level":3,"text":"手动控制刷新","id":"手动控制刷新"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":3,"text":"组件级错误处理","id":"组件级错误处理"},{"level":3,"text":"全局错误页面","id":"全局错误页面"},{"level":2,"text":"Payload 与 SSR 数据传递","id":"payload-与-ssr-数据传递"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nuxt 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"Nuxt 部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/nuxt-deployment"}}